Pekerja pergi ke lokasi,

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:42.460
memindainya,

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.660
dan memasukkan jumlah fisik

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:44.140
yang terlihat.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.580
Dynamics 365

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:46.720
membandingkan angka tersebut

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.600
dengan jumlah yang tercatat.

